<BaseLayout
  title="For Brands & Retailers"
  description="Information for brands and retailers interested in relevant affiliate partnerships with Australian Home Collective."
>
  <header class="page-intro">
    <div class="narrow">
      <h1>For Brands &amp; Retailers</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Australian Home Collective is an independent Australian home-guidance publication. We help readers research household purchases by looking at fit, suitability, installation, maintenance and everyday use.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <section class="content narrow">
    <h2>Who we reach</h2>
    <p>Our content is written for Australian households making decisions about appliances, cleaning, cooling, storage, home technology and other products used around the home.</p>

    <h2>Ways we can work together</h2>
    <p>Relevant products and retailers may be considered for inclusion in buying guides, product comparisons and contextual recommendations. We also share selected guides through our organic social channels. Every proposed placement must fit the question the guide is helping a reader answer.</p>

    <h2>How we make editorial decisions</h2>
    <p>A partnership does not guarantee coverage or a positive recommendation. We assess products for suitability and drawbacks, distinguish research from hands-on testing, and disclose qualifying affiliate links. Product details and Australian availability must be checked before a placement is published.</p>
    <p>Read <a href="/how-we-select-products/">how we select products and guide topics</a>, our <a href="/editorial-standards/">Editorial Standards</a> and our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.</p>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>For retailer and affiliate partnership enquiries, email <a href="mailto:contact@australianhomecollective.com.au">contact@australianhomecollective.com.au</a> or use our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>. Please include the product category, Australian availability and the proposed partnership details.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
